## A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects
## including temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular .NET tools. If you are
## developing with Visual Studio, the VS .gitignore
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore
## has more thorough IDE-specific entries.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# dotenv environment variables file
.env

# Per-developer local overrides -- RetrosharpConfiguration/MessagingConfiguration
# (src/lib/Retrosharp/Configuration) load these for any component, and they're the
# natural place to put real local connection strings/credentials, so they must never
# be committed. appsettings.json itself stays tracked with placeholder values only.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# Visual Studio
**/.vs

# Retrosheet source data downloaded locally for ETL testing (referenced by file path
# at runtime, not a build-embedded resource -- see spec/person.md, spec/game-log.md).
# Recursive: season data is sometimes organised into docs/csv/<year>/... subfolders.
biodata/
docs/csv/**/gl*.txt
docs/csv/**/biofile*.csv
docs/csv/**/*.EVN
docs/csv/**/*.EVA
docs/csv/**/*.ROS
docs/csv/**/*eve.zip
docs/csv/gl*.txt
docs/csv/biofile*.csv
docs/csv/*.EVN
docs/csv/*.EVA
docs/csv/*.ROS

# docker-compose bind mount for the ETL containers' Retrosheet source files
# (season event-file zips for bulk import, biofiles, game logs). Keep the folder,
# ignore its contents. See spec/bulk-import.md.
/data/retrosheet/*
!/data/retrosheet/.gitkeep

# Transient per-run extraction directory the bulk import saga creates next to the
# source zip (or under BulkImport__ExtractionRoot) and normally cleans up itself;
# left behind for any file that failed to import. Never belongs in source control.
_bulk-import/